VulkanOptics (optics::)
======================

Reusable Vulkan screen-space material compositor. Draw host-owned
glass/reflective material targets, then composite inside an active compatible
presentation render pass. The host owns the rasterizer, masks, G-buffer,
opaque scene color, and swapchain. No GL/GLFW or Vulkan global scene coupling.

Effects: screen-visible reflection rays, Fresnel glass reflection,
refraction through the opaque G-buffer, tint, and rough/matte filtering.
Unresolvable/off-screen reflections produce zero reflection radiance;
no probe, cubemap, or BVH fallback is used.

Host controls GPU work by skipping the compositor entirely when there are
no optical materials. Avoid binding the same image as source and destination.

API: optics/optics.hpp; GLSL shader: optics/shaders/compose.frag
